You are given a differential game logic (dGL) game loop, an analysis (what plays Angel and Demon have, what are the game's control modes), and a strategic plan for Angel to maintain a post condition.
During the execution of this plan, certain variables are going to evolve in value, and we need to establish polynomial bounds on these variables.

You must produce a SINGLE concise polynomial bound formula for the requested variable upper/lower bound.

